uscdn.com&oh=00_Afv5mNNcNADX9u3NHncy5klot4aY9HSVxfKG3PPz4dgxLg&oe=699AEBAE"}, {"file_name": "still 3.png", "id": "2364781913960894", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820558_2364781917294227_6286268374579906745_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tp7XBaHwTw8Q7kNvwHSRc62&_nc_oc=AdlgNjuP35NGC-cwQ6Kf8tdGB4Q0xdhR26QrOMTfB1bnW4lLjfPgPQA3havidj4BoeI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvnkJ2Y8hapwr8oiwSAJgbEGGdv9rQ9vb5R75H8SuYc3Q&oe=699AE4A7"}, {"file_name": "still 5.png", "id": "1516202909487617", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819854_1516202912820950_1194796726858880456_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=boKz7JDMCpkQ7kNvwGLbgYK&_nc_oc=AdnBUspzunMGiK5IF4le-3xUvU1xGOVL8zWRJ4t5Mp5xwZ0OpMvzuJVvj7Bv7zzqHRQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfunBkWgg_g6k3IVN5GVTYFfvvtGEH9LBKY2JazmiTnQ4g&oe=699AF255"}, {"file_name": "still 6.png", "id": "1415620343253395", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819375_1415620346586728_7294806654877176970_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nUwb_JMi9LEQ7kNvwHpQYgt&_nc_oc=AdmUbqJ5GbL9yyw9ftr8px7h0M7Ge32iF3mPk8R4015xvL3hEBhZROQ9bqMaG-_3E6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftm0F8uHumoOEzSU_6-rYGN_jGldP0ARi6dfjoHzpz0kA&oe=699AE05B"}, {"file_name": "still 1.png", "id": "1765534908166923", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_1765534911500256_4266532870211439759_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0yuUGGfHAmQQ7kNvwEmWlEI&_nc_oc=Adn6wO5FgJQNgfH14wnr5Rq4QDuH3DEGf3yBsHxol-afASFDGbXUsrH5jcMvsX7W7tA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsMZUgbCnx-9TUYFyJC6LYLmOohVmEU1FMYyOOtQyZaCw&oe=699AEC76"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Who's the King?!", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\ud83d\udc96 WHO\u2019S THE QUEEN \ud83d\udc96\n\n\ud83e\ude91 Sit on the throne!\n\nGrab your heart-shaped scepter \ud83d\udc96, keep your eyes wide open \ud83d\udc40, and decide who gets to enter your royal court. Every visitor matters\u2026 and every mistake could cost you your crown \ud83d\udc51\ud83d\udca5.\n\n{1615794056264358}\n\n\ud83d\udc8c Choose Your Valentine\n\nSelect your special Valentine, whether a charming king or a lovely queen. Share kisses \ud83d\ude18, give special gifts \ud83c\udf81, and have them by your side as you judge the court's affairs.\n\n{2230833630778102}\n\n\u2696\ufe0f Judge. Decide. Love.\n\nSearch for suitors \ud83d\udc98, treat the lovesick \ud83d\udc94, and banish those who threaten your romance. If justice demands it? Off with their heads! \ud83d\ude35\u200d\ud83d\udcab\u2694\ufe0f\n\n{1271212228167016}\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Avoid the Heartbreak!\n\nThe court is buzzing with emotions \ud83d\ude21\u2764\ufe0f. Be fair, be clever, or be ruthless - but don\u2019t push your subjects too far\u2026 A bad queen doesn\u2019t last long \ud83e\udea7\ud83d\udd25.\n\n{1386775932368428}\n\n\ud83c\udfad Cartoon chaos, twisted romance\n\nA colorful, unhinged cartoon world \ud83e\udd2a where love and power collide. Absurd situations, dark humor, and impossible choices \u2014 just like Scan or Scam, but with a heart-shaped twist \ud83d\udc96.\n\nRule wisely\u2026 or lose everything.\n\nSo tell us - Who\u2019s the Queen? \ud83d\udc40\ud83d\udc51", "short_description": "\ud83d\udc96 WHO\u2019S THE QUEEN \ud83d\udc96\nSit on the throne \ud83e\ude91, grab your heart-shaped scepter \ud83d\udc96, and judge who enters your royal court. Choose your Valentine, share kisses \ud83d\ude18, give special gifts \ud83c\udf81, and keep the love alive! Protect your kingdom from heartbreak \ud83d\udc94 or face a romantic revolution \ud83d\udd25. A chaotic, cartoonish power fantasy in the spirit of Scan or Scam!"}]}, "developer_name": "Kalank Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/whos-the-king-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_s